<p>New neighbours become members once enough existing members have vouched for them <strong>in person</strong>, by scanning the QR code on their dashboard.</p>
<p>Use this thread to arrange a time and place to meet, for example the lobby on a weekday evening. Members and neighbours waiting to be vouched for can all read and reply here.</p>
<p><strong>Anyone who has signed up can read this thread, including people who haven't been vouched for yet.</strong> Don't post flat numbers, phone numbers or anything you wouldn't pin on a noticeboard in the lobby, and meet somewhere shared.</p>
